# S016028 candidate summary

New destination: `src/include/uapi/asm-generic/termbits-common.rs`

The candidate adds the two fixed-width UAPI aliases and all 45 selected source
macros. It preserves the source names and values for the input and output flags,
the sixteen common baud selectors, `EXTA`/`EXTB`, the three high c_cflag bits,
`IBSHIFT`, all four tcflow selectors, and all three tcflush selectors. The
file is unconditional for the frozen x86_64/aarch64 union and carries the
source SPDX expression plus immutable provenance.
